Z||000005||perks88gt||05-18-2001||06:30 PM||||For the time being, I will be kind and not bash that organization.  I have been a FOCOA member for years and years, and I have never been satisfied with the qaulity of the publication.  Let alone I only receive two or three a year, the current issue is two partial issues put together.  Nice 3.4 car on the cover, to bad we will have to wait for the next issue to read about it...??  What ever, ||||reg||13
Z||000006||2M4 Dale||05-19-2001||08:38 AM||||I really wish that Phil and Gloria (the people who run FOCOA) would expand thier operation somewhat. I think that they do this stuff by themselves. I have met both of them and they seem to be very nice folks and very dedicated Fiero people. HOWEVER, the magazine needs to be published and mailed on time - 4 times a year........thats the agreement for membership. I got 3 magazines last year and now I'm sure that I will only get 3 this year (don't hold my breath) and they are always late. I have not been disapointed with the quality of the magazine. Only the sporadic reception of it. I am proud to be a member of FOCOA and I intend to be a member for a long time. I enjoy the annual Fiero Festivals etc. But if someone out there comes up with a national club thats more responsive......I'm gone !||||reg||1
