Z||000010||tgowens||05-23-2001||02:54 AM||||It is my understanding that, with the changes that FOCOA (the club) is undergoing at the moment, the magazine <I>will</I> be published quarterly and mailed out quarterly to each member. I <I>do</I> know that through the web site I am working on you will be able to voice your concerns with the Regional Director in your area. Hopefully this will all be straightened out by around the middle of July and you will see FOCOA being more agressive and more responsive in the future.<P>------------------<BR>My Fiero Web Site.....<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tgowens.gif">              </A><P>87 GT - 2.8L Gold automatic<BR>87 GT - 2.8L Blue automatic<BR>87 GT - 3.4L Blue 5-speed Getrag<BR>87 GT - 2.8L Med. Red Met. 5-speed Getrag<BR>88 Coupe - 2.5L Red automatic||||reg||1
